# Registers the listener that ApplicationTest uses to get hold of the context
# that main() starts and discards. spring.factories is the version-stable way to register
# an ApplicationListener; the context.listener.classes property this previously relied on
# is no longer honoured. The listener ignores every context that does not carry the marker
# property that test passes, so it can never capture — or close — a cached test context.
org.springframework.context.ApplicationListener=com.pigfox.springboot.ApplicationTest$ContextCapture
